{"title": "External Digestion", "pageid": 31075, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/External_Digestion", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>External Digestion</b> is a passive feature that allows its user to <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\">Devour</a> certain enemies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/20px-Bite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/30px-Bite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/40px-Bite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/20px-Bite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\">Devour</a> any creature that is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a> and steeping in its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Digestive Juices\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\">Digestive Juices</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Shambling_Mound\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound\">Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\">devour</a> any creature that is <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(status_group)\" title=\"Restrained (status group)\">restrained</a> and steeping in its <a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\">digestive juices</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715031449\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1213/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4085/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 190/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 873095/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.255      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.255      1 -total\n 27.87%   10.940      2 Template:SmCond\n 26.74%   10.496      1 Template:SmSAI\n 18.11%    7.107      3 Template:Icon_link\n 16.96%    6.656      3 Template:Icon_text\n 14.39%    5.650      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.57%    4.934      6 Template:Trim\n  9.03%    3.546      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.43%    3.311      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache w